# Docker 容器化部署规范

## Dockerfile 编写规范

### 标准 Dockerfile 模板
```dockerfile
FROM openjdk:8-jre-alpine

LABEL maintainer="your-email@example.com"
LABEL description="Spring Boot Microservice"

# 设置时区
RUN ln -sf /usr/share/zoneinfo/Asia/Shanghai /etc/localtime \
    && echo 'Asia/Shanghai' > /etc/timezone

# 工作目录
WORKDIR /app

# 复制依赖包（分层优化，依赖不常变）
COPY target/lib /app/lib

# 复制应用jar包
COPY target/*.jar /app/app.jar

# 复制配置文件（可选）
COPY start/*.yml /app/config/

# SkyWalking Agent（可选）
COPY target/tmp/skywalking-agent /app/skywalking-agent

# 暴露端口
EXPOSE 8080

# JVM参数
ENV JAVA_OPTS="-Xms512m -Xmx1024m -XX:+UseG1GC"

# 启动命令
ENTRYPOINT ["sh", "-c", "java $JAVA_OPTS -Djava.security.egd=file:/dev/./urandom -jar /app/app.jar"]
```

### 带 SkyWalking 的 Dockerfile
```dockerfile
FROM openjdk:8-jre-alpine

WORKDIR /app

COPY target/lib /app/lib
COPY target/*.jar /app/app.jar
COPY target/tmp/skywalking-agent /app/skywalking-agent

EXPOSE 8080

ENV JAVA_OPTS="-Xms512m -Xmx1024m"
ENV SW_AGENT_NAME="spring-boot-bean"
ENV SW_AGENT_COLLECTOR_BACKEND_SERVICES="127.0.0.1:11800"

ENTRYPOINT ["sh", "-c", "java $JAVA_OPTS \
    -javaagent:/app/skywalking-agent/skywalking-agent.jar \
    -Dskywalking.agent.service_name=$SW_AGENT_NAME \
    -Dskywalking.collector.backend_service=$SW_AGENT_COLLECTOR_BACKEND_SERVICES \
    -jar /app/app.jar"]
```

## Docker Compose 编排规范

### 单服务示例
```yaml
version: '3.8'

services:
  spring-boot-bean:
    build:
      context: .
      dockerfile: Dockerfile
    image: spring-boot-bean:1.0.0
    container_name: spring-boot-bean
    restart: always
    ports:
      - "8080:8080"
    environment:
      - SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=prod
      - NACOS_HOST=nacos
      - NACOS_PORT=8848
      - MYSQL_HOST=mysql
      - MYSQL_PORT=3306
      - REDIS_HOST=redis
      - REDIS_PORT=6379
    volumes:
      - ./logs:/app/logs
      - ./config:/app/config
    networks:
      - spring-cloud-net
    depends_on:
      - mysql
      - redis
      - nacos
    healthcheck:
      test: ["CMD", "wget", "--quiet", "--tries=1", "--spider", "http://localhost:8080/actuator/health"]
      interval: 30s
      timeout: 10s
      retries: 3

networks:
  spring-cloud-net:
    driver: bridge
```

