## 镜像构建脚本规范

### docker-image-build.sh
每个服务模块下都有 `docker-image-build.sh` 脚本：

```bash
#!/bin/bash

# 服务名称
SERVICE_NAME="spring-boot-bean"
# 版本号
VERSION="1.0.0"
# 镜像名称
IMAGE_NAME="${SERVICE_NAME}:${VERSION}"

echo "=========================================="
echo "开始构建 ${SERVICE_NAME} 镜像"
echo "=========================================="

# 1. Maven打包
echo "1. Maven打包..."
cd ../..
mvn clean package -pl spring-boot-business/${SERVICE_NAME} -am -DskipTests

# 2. 切换到服务目录
cd spring-boot-business/${SERVICE_NAME}

# 3. 构建Docker镜像
echo "2. 构建Docker镜像..."
docker build -t ${IMAGE_NAME} .

# 4. 打标签
echo "3. 打标签..."
docker tag ${IMAGE_NAME} registry.example.com/${IMAGE_NAME}

# 5. 推送镜像（可选）
# echo "4. 推送镜像..."
# docker push registry.example.com/${IMAGE_NAME}

echo "=========================================="
echo "镜像构建完成: ${IMAGE_NAME}"
echo "=========================================="
```

## 启动脚本规范

### start.sh (Linux)
位于 `start/start.sh`：

```bash
#!/bin/bash

APP_NAME="spring-boot-bean"
JAR_NAME="${APP_NAME}.jar"

# JVM参数
JAVA_OPTS="-Xms512m -Xmx1024m -XX:+UseG1GC -XX:MaxGCPauseMillis=200"

# 应用参数
APP_OPTS="--spring.profiles.active=prod"

# SkyWalking参数（可选）
SW_OPTS="-javaagent:./skywalking-agent/skywalking-agent.jar \
         -Dskywalking.agent.service_name=${APP_NAME} \
         -Dskywalking.collector.backend_service=127.0.0.1:11800"

# 日志目录
LOG_DIR="./logs"
mkdir -p ${LOG_DIR}

# 检查进程
PID=$(ps -ef | grep ${JAR_NAME} | grep -v grep | awk '{print $2}')

if [ -n "$PID" ]; then
    echo "${APP_NAME} is already running (PID: ${PID})"
    exit 1
fi

# 启动应用
echo "Starting ${APP_NAME}..."
nohup java ${JAVA_OPTS} ${SW_OPTS} -jar ${JAR_NAME} ${APP_OPTS} \
    > ${LOG_DIR}/application.log 2>&1 &

sleep 3

# 检查启动结果
PID=$(ps -ef | grep ${JAR_NAME} | grep -v grep | awk '{print $2}')
if [ -n "$PID" ]; then
    echo "${APP_NAME} started successfully (PID: ${PID})"
else
    echo "${APP_NAME} failed to start"
    exit 1
fi
```

### stop.sh
```bash
#!/bin/bash

APP_NAME="spring-boot-bean"
JAR_NAME="${APP_NAME}.jar"

PID=$(ps -ef | grep ${JAR_NAME} | grep -v grep | awk '{print $2}')

if [ -z "$PID" ]; then
    echo "${APP_NAME} is not running"
    exit 1
fi

echo "Stopping ${APP_NAME} (PID: ${PID})..."
kill -15 ${PID}

# 等待进程结束
for i in {1..30}; do
    PID=$(ps -ef | grep ${JAR_NAME} | grep -v grep | awk '{print $2}')
    if [ -z "$PID" ]; then
        echo "${APP_NAME} stopped successfully"
        exit 0
    fi
    sleep 1
done

# 强制杀死
echo "Force killing ${APP_NAME}..."
kill -9 ${PID}
echo "${APP_NAME} stopped"
```

### restart.sh
```bash
#!/bin/bash

./stop.sh
sleep 2
./start.sh
```

